# GitHub issues and commit messages

Repository: `alpdogan/obscuropay`. Issue text and commit messages are English.

Before writing code or a commit message, run `gh issue list --repo alpdogan/obscuropay --state open --limit 50`. Match the diff to one open issue by title and body. Do not guess a number.

- If no open issue matches, open one with `gh issue create` before the change. Do not start the work without an issue.
- A commit that finishes the issue ends with `Fixes #<number>`.
- A commit that only advances it ends with `Refs #<number>`.
- One issue per commit. Do not invent a number, and do not leave the trailer off. Never copy a number from an example. The only valid number is the one `gh issue list` returned for this diff.

```
feat: short summary of the change

Fixes #<matched issue number>
```
